<title>UK: Wachovia Bank sets $350 million five-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Wachovia Bank sets $350 million five-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue</p>
<p>was announced by lead manager Merrill Lynch International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WACHOVIA BANK OF NORTH CAROLINA</p>
<p> AMT	  $350 MLN  BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    23.MAY.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     -6.25 BP  PAY DATE    23.MAY.97</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 ISS PRICE  99.73     FULL FEES   0.175</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 REOFFER    99.73</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 250	 SALE LIMITS US/GB</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  U.S.	TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.075     SELL CONC  0.10	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
